Package: zerodds-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZeroDDS command-line tools
 Pure-Rust DDS implementation conformant to OMG DDS 1.4 + DDSI-RTPS 2.5
 + DDS-Security 1.2 + DDS-XTypes 1.3.
 .
 This package provides the user-facing CLI tools:
   * dds-admin       — runtime introspection + topic listing
   * dds-perf        — throughput / latency benchmark generator
   * dds-idlc        — OMG-IDL compiler with C++/C#/Java/TS/Python backends
   * dds-xmlc        — DDS-XML schema/sample compiler
   * dds-replay      — recording playback (.zddsrec format)
   * dds-traceability — wire-trace decoder
   * dds-chaos       — network-chaos proxy for soak testing
   * roundtrip-1us   — sub-microsecond latency bench

Package: libzerodds-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZeroDDS C-FFI development headers
 C/C++ headers + import-libraries for linking ZeroDDS into native
 applications via the dds-c-api FFI layer (zerodds.h).

Package: libzerodds0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZeroDDS C-FFI runtime library
 Shared-object form of the dds-c-api crate; required at runtime by C/C++
 applications + ROS-2 RMW shim consumers.

Package: librmw-zerodds
Architecture: any
Depends: libzerodds0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ROS-2 RMW implementation backed by ZeroDDS
 ROS-2 plugin (ament-cmake-package) implementing the RMW (ROS Middleware)
 interface against ZeroDDS. Compatible with ROS-2 Humble, Iron, Jazzy.
